    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 13</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif man hwilcne man téo, þæt he þone man féde þe ures hlafordes grið tóbrocen habbe, ladige hine mid þrinna XII, ⁊ se geréfa namige þa lade.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone is accused of furnishing with food a man who has broken our lord's peace, he shall clear himself with three times twelve compurgators who shall be nominated by the reeve.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et si aliquis accuseter, quod eum pauerit, qui pacem domini nostri fregerit, ladiet se mid þrinna XII (id est cum ter XII, qui faciunt triginta sex); et prepositus nominet ipsam ladam.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
